  (text "R7 with C7: rise from 48.2 Hz\nR7 with C6: roll-off above 2.19 kHz\nR8 with C7: 4.82 kHz (full Presence)\nboost about +12 dB (min) to +30 dB (max)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 132.08 101.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c76e07d0-6f0e-5eeb-9208-4696f4ffdf44"))
  (text "Section 4 of the circuit notes. IC2_C: H = 1 + Zf/Zg, Zf = R7 || C6, Zg = C7 + R8 + the Presence pot, as traced [2]:\nunity at DC and a boost-only rise in the upper mids. RVX1: the traced 100 kOhm linear pot as a rheostat;\nthe DSP sweeps it log-uniformly from 103.3 kOhm to 3.3 kOhm instead (chosen, section 4).\nSection 6: there are no clipping diodes [2]. The op-amp clips at its rails, about +/-3.1 V around VB (railV, inferred\nfrom the TL07x datasheet [4]); the DSP's knee and its 2 mV input offset (vos) are chosen." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d6ef2957-4429-57bb-9e5e-8bbf0c0a6c24"))
